# Mosquitto ACL for Smart Football (step 8a)
# Anything not listed here is denied.

# Backend: read-only on every device topic
user backend
topic read smartfootball/+/events
topic read smartfootball/+/status

# Goal ESP32: may only publish on its own topics
user goal-esp32-01
topic write smartfootball/goal-esp32-01/events
topic write smartfootball/goal-esp32-01/status